tent processing pipeline for user posts. This ensures that submitted Markdown is safely sanitized before storage and that inputs meet specific length and security criteria to prevent XSS and spam.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Created sanitization and validation logic for user content","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:50:14.581Z","title":"Implement Markdown processing and validation utilities","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxnnh8_837280fba41a":{"observation":{"concepts":["Task management","Workflow state transition"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Task ID 4 status updated to completed","Previous status was in_progress","Update operation successful"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpwxnnh8_837280fba41a","importance":3,"narrative":"Task 4 was successfully transitioned to the completed state. This update confirms the closure of the associated work item within the task management system.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Status transition from in_progress to completed","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:50:16.965Z","title":"Task 4 marked as completed","type":"task"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxokrq_180f8e732ecc":{"observation":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","Server-side data fetching","Data tree normalization","TypeScript interfaces"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Created /src/lib/server/forum.ts to encapsulate forum business logic.","Defined interfaces CategoryRow, ThreadRow, and PostRow for type safety.","Implemented recursive category tree building in getCategories.","Includes boilerplate for CRUD operations on forum categories and thread pagination."],"files":["src/lib/server/forum.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwxokrq_180f8e732ecc","importance":6,"narrative":"I established a dedicated server-side utility layer for the forum features, utilizing Drizzle ORM to interface with the database. This module centralizes data fetching and includes type definitions that map to the underlying forum and auth schemas, providing a clean API for components to consume.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Implemented data fetching layer for forum features using Drizzle ORM","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:51:00.108Z","title":"Created server-side forum logic module","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxon9s_cddb2f368584":{"observation":{"concepts":["Task tracking","Workflow state management"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Task ID 6 status changed from 'pending' to 'in_progress'","Update confirmed successful by backend response"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpwxon9s_cddb2f368584","importance":2,"narrative":"The status of task 6 was updated to indicate that work has officially commenced. This change tracks the progression of the development workflow within the agent's task management system.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Transitioned task 6 state in management system","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:51:03.349Z","title":"Task 6 status updated to in_progress","type":"task"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxonc1_3788fd5c4948":{"observation":{"concepts":["task management","state transition"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Task ID 5 status updated to completed","Transition confirmed via TaskUpdate tool"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpwxonc1_3788fd5c4948","importance":3,"narrative":"Task 5 was successfully transitioned from 'in_progress' to 'completed'. This reflects progress in the current workflow and ensures the task tracking system accurately represents the current state of work.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Status transition from in_progress to completed","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:51:03.429Z","title":"Task 5 marked as completed","type":"task"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxoqfm_58fc63ddec4a":{"observation":{"concepts":["Next.js API routes","Directory structure","REST API design"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Created directories: src/pages/api/forum/threads, src/pages/api/forum/posts, src/pages/api/forum/mod","Used mkdir -p to ensure parent directories exist"],"files":["src/pages/api/forum/threads","src/pages/api/forum/posts","src/pages/api/forum/mod"],"id":"obs_mpwxoqfm_58fc63ddec4a","importance":4,"narrative":"The project structure is being expanded to support a modular API for a forum system. By grouping threads, posts, and moderation endpoints under the /forum namespace, the codebase maintains logical separation and follows Next.js API route conventions.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Initialize routing directories for forum backend","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:51:07.447Z","title":"Create forum API directory structure","type":"command_run"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxp6ch_ac544296bb4b":{"observation":{"concepts":["API rate limiting","database transactions","spam prevention","input validation","Astro API routes"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented rate-limiting (10s) using an in-memory Map.","Integrated anti-spam logic for accounts younger than 7 days.","Enforced ban checks via isUserBanned integration.","Used Drizzle transaction to atomize thread creation, post insertion, and category metadata updates.","Included validation for thread title, content length, and locked categories."],"files":["src/pages/api/forum/thread/index.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwxp6ch_ac544296bb4b","importance":6,"narrative":"Created an API endpoint for creating new forum threads that incorporates essential safety features. It validates user permissions, checks for spam signals based on account age, and ensures database consistency using transactional inserts.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Added POST handler for creating new threads with security checks","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:51:28.069Z","title":"Implement Forum Thread Creation Endpoint","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxpexk_d1aeafeb719a":{"observation":{"concepts":["API routes","Drizzle ORM transactions","Rate limiting","Moderation logic","Astro API handlers"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Enforces authentication and rate limiting (10s threshold).","Integrates thread locking checks, user ban status, and spam protection for new accounts (< 7 days).","Uses Drizzle ORM transactions to update forumPost, increment thread reply count, and increment category post count.","Parses markdown content before storage."],"files":["src/pages/api/forum/posts/create.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwxpexk_d1aeafeb719a","importance":6,"narrative":"Implemented the server-side API for creating forum posts. The endpoint ensures data integrity via database transactions and incorporates necessary moderation layers including anti-spam, ban checks, and rate limiting.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Created /api/forum/posts/create.ts endpoint","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:51:39.199Z","title":"Implemented Forum Post Creation API","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxpmu5_28798f6a754d":{"observation":{"concepts":["Astro API Routes","Drizzle ORM","Markdown processing","RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Endpoint handles POST requests at /api/forum/posts/edit","Requires authentication via getCurrentUser","Supports editing by original author or authorized moderators","Updates contentMd, renders contentHtml, and sets isEdited flag via Drizzle","Logs mod actions when a post is modified by someone other than the author"],"files":["src/pages/api/forum/posts/edit.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwxpmu5_28798f6a754d","importance":6,"narrative":"Created an API route to handle forum post updates. The logic validates content, ensures authorization (author or moderator), updates the database schema, and logs moderation activity if applicable.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Implemented server-side post editing with moderation support","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:51:49.445Z","title":"Create forum post edit API route","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxps2m_59f009764f9c":{"observation":{"concepts":["soft-delete","API route handler","RBAC (Role Based Access Control)","Drizzle ORM"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Endpoint handles user authentication and permission checks (author vs moderator).","Implements soft-delete by setting isDeleted to true and clearing content fields.","Moderator actions are logged via logModAction when authorized.","Includes error handling and standard JSON response formatting."],"files":["src/pages/api/forum/posts/delete.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwxps2m_59f009764f9c","importance":5,"narrative":"Created a new POST API endpoint to handle the deletion of forum posts. The implementation uses a soft-delete pattern to preserve thread coherence and incorporates role-based authorization checks to allow either the post author or a moderator to perform the action.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Soft-delete logic for forum posts in Astro/Drizzle","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:51:56.230Z","title":"Implemented forum post delete API endpoint","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxpvd0_fae1223145eb":{"observation":{"concepts":["Astro API Routes","Drizzle ORM","Authentication Middleware","Input Sanitization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Endpoint implemented at /src/pages/api/forum/posts/report.ts","Enforces authentication via getCurrentUser","Uses Drizzle ORM to insert records into forumReports table","Implements input validation for postId and reason","Includes error logging via logError utility"],"files":["src/pages/api/forum/posts/report.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwxpvd0_fae1223145eb","importance":5,"narrative":"Created a new Astro API endpoint to handle user reports on forum posts. The implementation ensures that only authenticated users can report content and validates that a reason is provided before inserting the record into the database.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Implemented POST handler for reporting forum posts","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:52:00.475Z","title":"Created forum post report API endpoint","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxpys3_16cdfac3510f":{"observation":{"concepts":["Astro API Routes","Markdown rendering","Server-side validation","Auth middleware"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Created endpoint at /src/pages/api/forum/preview.ts","Enforces authentication via getCurrentUser","Validates input content using validatePostContent","Returns rendered HTML via renderMarkdown"],"files":["src/pages/api/forum/preview.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwxpys3_16cdfac3510f","importance":5,"narrative":"Implemented a new API route to handle server-side Markdown rendering for forum post previews. This ensures consistent styling and validation before content is submitted to the database.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Implemented /api/forum/preview.ts for real-time content rendering","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:52:04.920Z","title":"Created Markdown preview API endpoint","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxq4wo_be5b30d170cc":{"observation":{"concepts":["Astro APIRoute","Drizzle ORM","RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)","Audit Logging"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Created POST handler in /src/pages/api/forum/mod/pin.ts","Integrates with Drizzle ORM for thread state management","Enforces authorization via canModerate check","Implements audit logging via logModAction"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/forum/mod/pin.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwxq4wo_be5b30d170cc","importance":5,"narrative":"Implemented a new server-side API endpoint for forum moderators to pin or unpin threads. The logic validates user authentication, verifies moderation permissions based on category, updates the thread state in the database, and logs the action for audit purposes.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Implemented thread pinning/unpinning logic for moderators","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:52:12.864Z","title":"Created forum pin API endpoint","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxqfto_b98e72895860":{"observation":{"conce