tro API routes","Drizzle ORM","RBAC","Audit logging"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Endpoint handles POST requests to manage user moderator status based on category slugs.","Uses Drizzle ORM to interact with forumModerators and forumCategories tables.","Includes authorization check for 'admin' role.","Implements logging for both promotion and demotion actions.","Endpoint path: /api/forum/mod/promote.ts"],"files":["src/pages/api/forum/mod/promote.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwxqohy_515a0df6db01","importance":6,"narrative":"Implemented a new server-side API endpoint for administrators to manage forum moderators. The endpoint supports both promoting and revoking moderator privileges for specific users within a category, including audit logging for actions.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Implemented endpoint to promote or demote forum moderators","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:52:38.251Z","title":"Created forum moderator management API","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxqtdm_3be7389bda6f":{"observation":{"concepts":["Astro API routes","Drizzle ORM","Role-based access control","Moderation workflow"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Endpoint handles both GET (queue retrieval) and POST (status update) requests.","GET method checks for admin/moderator roles via getCurrentUser.","POST method updates forumReports table status, reviewer ID, and timestamp.","Includes server-side logging for errors and moderation actions."],"files":["src/pages/api/forum/mod/reports.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwxqtdm_3be7389bda6f","importance":6,"narrative":"Implemented the moderation API to allow admins and moderators to manage forum report status. The endpoint uses Astro API routes to handle authentication, database updates via Drizzle, and audit logging for administrative actions.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Created API handler for viewing and updating moderation reports","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:52:44.578Z","title":"Implemented forum moderation 