ive":"Created a reusable forum post component that displays author details, post content (via HTML injection), and provides metadata for a client-side React island. The component handles conditional rendering for deleted posts, locked threads, and admin/moderator actions.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Forum post display component with React integration","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:53:38.899Z","title":"Created PostComponent.astro","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxsii7_df55482e04ab":{"observation":{"concepts":["React hooks","Markdown rendering","Form handling","API integration"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added ReplyComposer with Markdown toolbar (Bold, Italic, Quote, Code).","Implemented conditional rendering for locked threads and unauthenticated users.","Integrated live preview via /api/forum/preview and submission via /api/forum/posts/create.","Used state management to handle composer tab switching (write/preview)."],"files":["components/ReplyComposer.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpwxsii7_df55482e04ab","importance":5,"narrative":"The ReplyComposer component was implemented to allow authenticated users to post replies to forum threads. It includes a WYSIWYG-style markdown helper toolbar, client-side validation for thread locking, and a preview feature to improve user experience.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Created form for forum thread replies with markdown support","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:54:03.796Z","title":"Implement ReplyComposer component","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxsxye_a3c06b84071b":{"observation":{"concepts":["React state management","Markdown editor","Form handling","DOM selection manipulation","API integration"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented ThreadComposer React component with state for title, content, and preview tab.","Added Markdown toolbar functionality with wrapText utility for selection manipulation.","Integrated API endpoints: /api/forum/preview