 fetches current user and categories on load","Conditional rendering for auth links and moderator panel based on user role","Uses CategoryCard component to render list of forum categories","Includes empty state handling if no categories are found"],"files":["src/pages/forum/index.astro"],"id":"obs_mpwxtlv7_82f765aca9c5","importance":5,"narrative":"Implemented the main index page for the forum, enabling dynamic display of category data. Added authentication-aware UI elements such as login/register buttons for guests and an administrative panel link for authorized staff.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Implemented forum landing page with category listing","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:54:54.811Z","title":"Created forum index page","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxtona_9c1e66cc2b02":{"observation":{"concepts":["Next.js dynamic routing","File system scaffolding"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Directory structure created: src/pages/forum/[category]","Standardized Next.js dynamic routing path pattern"],"files":["src/pages/forum/[category]"],"id":"obs_mpwxtona_9c1e66cc2b02","importance":4,"narrative":"Created the required directory for dynamic routing within the forum module. This structure enables parameter-based routing for different forum categories in the Next.js application.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Bash command: mkdir -p \"src/pages/forum/[category]\"","timestamp":"2026-06-02T17:54:58.412Z","title":"Created dynamic routing directory for forum categories","type":"command_run"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwxu5dc_dcc2783b0f15":{"observation":{"concepts":["Astro Islands","Server-side data fetching","Component composition","Responsive grid layout"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented server-side data fetching for categories and threads using getCategoryBySlug and getThreads.","Added authentication check via getCurrentUser.","Integrated ThreadComposer React component with hydration client:l