613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Added autoCreateMatchThread logic to live-matches.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:15:38.685Z","title":"Implement auto-creation of match threads","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwykf5n_e81c116d2cbc":{"observation":{"concepts":["Astro dynamic routing","server-side rendering","component composition"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Imported MatchThread component for forum display","Imported getThreadByMatchId, getPosts, and getPostReactions server functions","Updated /pages/meciuri/[id].astro imports to support forum functionality"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/meciuri/[id].astro"],"id":"obs_mpwykf5n_e81c116d2cbc","importance":4,"narrative":"The match detail page is being expanded to include a forum-like thread component. I added the necessary imports from both the component directory and the forum server module to prepare for the implementation of match-specific discussions.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Injecting forum logic into [id].astro","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:15:45.826Z","title":"Add forum components and server utilities to match page","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwykjbw_4c24df9cadab":{"observation":{"concepts":["Astro SSR","Data Fetching","Server-side Rendering","Error Handling"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added server-side logic to fetch match thread data using getThreadByMatchId.","Implemented initial post retrieval with pagination (page 1, perPage 5).","Added error handling using .catch(() => null) and .catch(() => ({ posts: [], total: 0 })) for robustness."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/meciuri/[id].astro"],"id":"obs_mpwykjbw_4c24df9cadab","importance":5,"narrative":"The agent modified the match page component to pre-fetch forum thread data on the server. This improves initial load performance and SEO by ensuring thread content is available during the initial SSR pass instead of waiting for client-side fetching.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Injecting server-side data fetching for match threads into [id].astro","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:15:51.233Z","title":"Implement SSR forum thread data fetching for match pages","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwykqi9_5ce1b21aeb6a":{"observation":{"concepts":["Astro islands","React component hydration","Server-side props passing","Data serialization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Injected MatchThread component into /src/pages/meciuri/[id].astro","Passed match context and current user session data to MatchThread props","Serialized initial forum posts for hydration using toISOString()","Used client:visible hydration strategy for the forum thread"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/meciuri/[id].astro"],"id":"obs_mpwykqi9_5ce1b21aeb6a","importance":5,"narrative":"The match detail page was updated to include a dynamic forum thread section. By passing server-side thread data and user authentication state to the MatchThread component, users can now view and interact with match-specific forum discussions directly within the match view.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Added forum thread embed to [id].astro","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:16:00.536Z","title":"Integrate MatchThread into match page","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwylais_d4e3daeb253e":{"observation":{"concepts":["database seeding","idempotent script","PostgreSQL migration","node.js CLI"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Script enables 'team_forums_enabled' flag in 'sports_competitions' for selected leagues.","Generates 'forum_categories' entries for active teams associated with those competitions.","Supports dry-run mode and manual competition selection via CLI arguments.","Uses PostgreSQL with 'postgres.js' and cuid2 for ID generation."],"files":["scripts/maintenance/seed-team-forums.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwylais_d4e3daeb253e","importance":6,"narrative":"Implemented a maintenance script to automate the creation of team-specific sub-forums for sports competitions. The script identifies active teams from target competitions, ensures parent category existence, and populates the database with new forum categories, ensuring idempotency by checking existing slugs.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"scripts/maintenance/seed-team-forums.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:16:26.470Z","title":"Created database seeding script for team forums","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwylf22_76e208aba3da":{"observation":{"concepts":["database seeding","dry run","maintenance script","automation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Script `scripts/maintenance/seed-team-forums.ts` executed in dry-run mode.","Targeted 20 teams for creation.","Selected competitions currently have `teamForumsEnabled: false`.","Script successfully identified all 20 teams without errors."],"files":["scripts/maintenance/seed-team-forums.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwylf22_76e208aba3da","importance":4,"narrative":"The team forum seeding script was executed in dry-run mode to verify its behavior before applying changes to the database. The output confirmed that 20 teams would be successfully created, validating the selection logic and script connectivity.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Verifying script logic before production execution","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:16:32.354Z","title":"Dry run of team forums seeding script","type":"command_run"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwyli8w_ea2ed6627fb2":{"observation":{"concepts":["data seeding","maintenance scripts","database initialization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Script: scripts/maintenance/seed-team-forums.ts","Enabled teamForumsEnabled for 5 Liga 1 competitions","Successfully created 20 team forum records"],"files":["scripts/maintenance/seed-team-forums.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwyli8w_ea2ed6627fb2","importance":5,"narrative":"The team forum initialization script was executed to enable forum functionality for Liga 1 competitions