ware layout"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added unreadNotifs logic using getUnreadCount in BasicLayout.astro","Implemented conditional check: if currentUser exists, fetch count; otherwise default to 0","Included .catch(() => 0) to handle potential errors in notification service calls gracefully"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/layout/BasicLayout.astro"],"id":"obs_mpwyzssd_455d10be39fb","importance":4,"narrative":"Modified the global layout component to fetch the unread notification count server-side. This ensures the notification state is available immediately upon page load for logged-in users, defaulting to zero if no user is authenticated or if the lookup fails.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Fetching notification count for authenticated users in Astro layout","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:27:43.331Z","title":"Integrate unread notification count into BasicLayout","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwyzvy1_dae12ad4e2bd":{"observation":{"concepts":["Astro components","state management","props drilling"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Modified /src/layout/BasicLayout.astro","Added unreadNotifs prop to the NavBar component","Data is sourced from getUnreadCount using the currentUser ID"],"files":["/src/layout/BasicLayout.astro"],"id":"obs_mpwyzvy1_dae12ad4e2bd","importance":4,"narrative":"The NavBar component was updated to include the unreadNotifs count. This ensures the user receives real-time visibility into their notification status across the application layout.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Integration of notification state into BasicLayout","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:27:47.423Z","title":"Update NavBar component to display unread notification count","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwyzy3w_e2e2c277e049":{"observation":{"concepts":["task tracking","workflow automation","state management"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Task ID 19 status transitioned from 'in_progress' to 'completed'","Update operation successful"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpwyzy3w_e2e2c277e049","importance":3,"narrative":"The task management system has been updated to reflect the completion of task 19. This state change confirms the successful conclusion of the current work item in the workflow.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Task status update lifecycle","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:27:50.228Z","title":"Task 19 marked as completed","type":"task"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwz01lm_79d60323177e":{"observation":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","Database transaction","Spam filtering","Rate limiting"],"confidence":1,"facts":["New accounts (< 7 days) are restricted by spam signals if they contain > 3 links","Banned users are blocked via isUserBanned check","Transaction ensures atomicity across forumPosts, forumThreads, and forumCategories tables","Uses Drizzle ORM SQL templates to increment counters"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/forum/posts/create.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwz01lm_79d60323177e","importance":4,"narrative":"Read the post creation endpoint to understand existing validation logic for new users and database update patterns. The code implements a transaction that updates post count and thread metadata, which is critical for maintaining consistency in the forum schema.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Reviewing post creation constraints and database transactions","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:27:54.749Z","title":"Read forum post creation logic","type":"file_read"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwz07ld_0c1a17bb571e":{"observation":{"concepts":["SSE (Server-Sent Events)","Notification system","Astro API Routes","Mentions logic"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Imported renderMentions, notifyMentions, notifyThreadReply, and sendSseMessage","Updated import list to reflect new helper dependencies in the forum module"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/forum/posts/create.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwz07ld_0c1a17bb571e","importance":5,"narrative":"Added necessary utilities to the forum post creation API endpoint to handle real-time notifications and live SSE updates. This is part of the implementation to ensure users are notified of mentions and thread replies instantly upon creating a post.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Update to /pages/api/forum/posts/create.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:28:02.516Z","title":"Integrate notification and live updates in post creation API","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwz0fh2_6958759c6b62":{"observation":{"concepts":["SSE (Server-Sent Events)","Drizzle ORM","Asynchronous notifications","Event-driven architecture"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added database query to fetch thread and category details for notifications","Implemented calls to notifyMentions and notifyThreadReply with error swallowing","Added sendSseMessage for live updates using the 'forum_new_post' event channel","Structured SSE payload with user metadata and post content"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/forum/posts/create.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwz0fh2_6958759c6b62","importance":6,"narrative":"Enhanced the forum post creation flow by integrating real-time server-sent events (SSE) and notification triggers. This ensures that users receive instant updates for replies or mentions and that active clients in a thread receive new posts without a page refresh.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Added real-time events and user notifications to forum posts","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:28:12.734Z","title":"Integrate Notifications and SSE in post creation","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwz0l8m_109f2fd1436e":{"observation":{"concepts":["Regex parsing","CSS color-mix","Sanitization pipeline","User mentions"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented renderMentions function to convert @username to HTML pill links","Regex targets @[a-zA-Z0-9_.-]{2,30} pattern","Styled with CSS variables (--sb-accent, --sb-paper) using color-mix for themed pill appearance","Placed logic before DOMPurify sanitization to ensure safe rendering"],"files":["src/lib/forum/markdown.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwz0l8m_109f2fd1436e","importance":4,"narrative":"Added a utility function to identify and transform @mentions into styled HTML pills. This implementation uses a specific regex for usernames and inline styles with CSS variables to integrate seamlessly with the existing design system before the markdown is sanitized.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Added renderMentions function to markdown utility","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:28:20.203Z","title":"Implement mention parsing for markdown","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwz0ole_664e70e28b6a":{"observation":{"concepts":["markdown parsing","HTML sanitization","mentions processing"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Modified renderMarkdown in markdown.ts","Inserted renderMentions(raw) call after markdown parsing but before sanitization"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/forum/markdown.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwz0ole_664e70e28b6a","importance":4,"narrative":"Modified the markdown rendering pipeline to include a mention-processing step. By calling renderMentions before sanitization, we ensure user handles in the markdown are processed into the appropriate HTML format while still respecting DOMPurify constraints.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Updating renderMarkdown to support user mentions","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:28:24.554Z","title":"Integrate renderMentions into markdown rendering pipeline","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwz0ujy_1724e093d074":{"observation":{"concepts":["DOMPurify","Markdown sanitization","XSS prevention"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Modified ALLOWED_ATTR in src/lib/forum/markdown.ts","Included 'style' attribute in the whitelist for DOMPurify.sanitize"],"files":["src/lib/forum/markdown.ts"],"id":"obs_mpwz0ujy_1724e093d074","importance":4,"narrative":"Added the 'style' attribute to the DOMPurify configuration within the markdown rendering pipeline. This change enables the rendering of inline styles in user-generated content, which is necessary for certain markdown-generated formatting.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Added 'style' to allowed attributes in markdown sanitizer","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:28:32.279Z","title":"Update DOMPurify allowed attributes","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwz12fm_fad7a4c927c6":{"observation":{"concepts":["Server-Sent Events","React useEffect","Real-time updates","State management"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented `EventSource` listening to `/api/live/events` for `forum_new_post` messages.","Added filtering logic to ignore posts from current user and posts belonging to different threads.","Updated component state (`posts`, `postCount`, `expanded`) upon receiving new posts via SSE.","Includes clean-up function to close the `EventSource` connection on component unmount."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/forum/MatchThread.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpwz12fm_fad7a4c927c6","importance":6,"narrative":"The MatchThread component was updated to support real-time interaction by listening for new forum posts via SSE. This ensures that users see updates from other participants instantly without requiring a page refresh or polling.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Added SSE listener to MatchThread component","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:28:42.486Z","title":"Implement real-time forum updates with Server-Sent Events (SSE)","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwz1c2c_065d22704614":{"observation":{"concepts":["Server-Sent Events (SSE)","React useEffect","DOM Manipulation","EventSource API"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Created file /src/components/react/forum/ThreadLiveUpdater.tsx","Uses EventSource to listen to /api/live/events for 'forum_new_post' event","Filters events by threadId and ignores current user's own posts","Displays a non-intrusive UI banner that triggers a page reload on click"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/forum/ThreadLiveUpdater.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpwz1c2c_065d22704614","importance":5,"narrative":"Implemented a real-time update mechanism for forum threads using Server-Sent Events (SSE). The component monitors for new posts and notifies the user via a dynamically injected banner, allowing them to manually refresh the page to view content without losing state until they are ready.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Implements SSE-based real-time post notifications","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:28:54.972Z","title":"Created ThreadLiveUpdater component","type":"file_write"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwz1f94_d3f843847a72":{"observation":{"concepts":["Astro components","React component integration","Real-time updates"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Imported ThreadLiveUpdater from ../../../components/react/forum/ThreadLiveUpdater","Modified /Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/forum/[category]/[thread].astro to include the new component in the import block"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/forum/[category]/[thread].astro"],"id":"obs_mpwz1f94_d3f843847a72","importance":5,"narrative":"The ThreadLiveUpdater component was imported into the Astro thread page template to enable real-time updates for forum discussions. This is a preliminary step towards implementing live interactivity in the thread view.","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","subtitle":"Added live updates component to forum thread view","timestamp":"2026-06-02T18:28:59.104Z","title":"Integrate ThreadLiveUpdater into thread page","type":"file_edit"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_mpwz1lbs_34677b70c5a1":{"observation":{"concepts":["SSE","Astro islands","Real-time updates","Forum UI"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Inserted ThreadLiveUpdater component into src/pages/forum/[category]/[